<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_III__cl_35> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_III__cl_35> <https://schema.org/text> "Subseksyen 47A(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “paragraph 9(1)(c)” dengan perkataan “subsection 9(3)”."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_II__cl_10> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
