<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_II__cl_21__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1A) For the purposes of this section, a company shall furnish to the Director General a return in the prescribed form on an electronic medium or by way of electronic transmission in accordance with section 152A.”; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
