<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_II__cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 4B seksyen yang berikut: “Gains or profits from a business arising from stock in trade parted with by any element of compulsion 4C. For the purpose of paragraph 4(a), gains or profits from a business shall include an amount receivable arising from stock in trade parted with by any element of compulsion including on requisition or compulsory acquisition or in a similar manner.”. Pindaan seksyen 6"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
