<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_II__cl_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
