<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_39__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_39__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “Subject to subsection” perkataan “(1A) or”; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
