<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@/~chp_IV__cl_42> <https://schema.org/text> "Subseksyen 83(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (ba) perenggan yang berikut: “(bb) providing for the scope and procedure applied in relation to any arrangement made under section 71A;”. Pindaan Jadual Pertama"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2013/22/msa@> .
